This branch exists so this repository always has a default branch.

disposable-env/bin/reset-target-repository.js returns this repository to the
empty state AI Gang's single-command startup pushes into. GitHub refuses to
delete a repository's default branch, so the reset makes this branch the
default and then deletes every other branch.

It is permanent: every generation of the disposable test environment reuses it,
nothing is ever pushed to it, and it shares no history with any branch a run
created. Do not build on it, and do not delete it.
